  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work the head and body in a skin-tone dk yarn and the tail pieces in teal or turquoise. Use a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-a73"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to start each piece."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Head"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "19-round sphere, 7 cm diameter. Fit 10 mm safety eyes between rounds 7 and 8. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 6 cm wide and 10 cm long. Use a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "colour-change-a73"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to switch to teal after the first 5 cm to suggest a shell top. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tail"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cone, 6 cm base and 10 cm tall in teal. Stuff lightly to hold shape."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fluke"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flat oval, 4 cm long and 8 cm wide in teal. Work two flukes and sew them together wrong sides facing. Do not stuff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the top of the body. Join the wide end of the tail cone to the base of the body. Sew the fluke to the narrow tip of the tail, angled horizontally like a real fish tail."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hair"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut lengths of yarn in a contrasting colour, each about 18 cm. Loop each length through the top and back of the head using a lark's head knot to build up the hair. Trim to an even length or leave uneven for a flowing look."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-decrease-a73"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " throughout for smooth shaping. Embroider a small smiling mouth in a dark thread. Weave in all ends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials needed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Approximately 23 g in skin-tone dk yarn, 15 g teal dk yarn. Small amount of contrast yarn for hair. 10 mm safety eyes. Polyester stuffing. Tapestry needle."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}